{{- /*
  Project override of themes/congo/layouts/_default/sitemap.xml (Congo 2.9.0).

  Hugo emits one sitemap per language at /fr/sitemap.xml and /en/sitemap.xml.
  Neither is used here:

    - the authoritative sitemap is the single flat bilingual one at
      /sitemap.xml (see layouts/sitemapindex.xml), which is the only sitemap
      advertised in robots.txt and the only one to submit to Search Console;
    - /fr/sitemap.xml would otherwise list URLs served from the site root, which
      a sitemap at that path is not allowed to cover, and /fr/ is the path being
      301-redirected after the language switch.

  Hugo gives no way to disable the per-language sitemaps in 0.119, so they are
  rendered as an empty, valid urlset. Nothing links to them.
*/ -}}
